            "title": "韓股早段升近1% 首爾綜合指數報4,751點升39點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">首爾綜合指數在開市初期向好，較早時錄得39點升幅，報4,751點，升幅為0.85%，帶動韓國股市早段造好近1%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17271850-%e9%9f%93%e8%82%a1%e6%97%a9%e6%ae%b5%e5%8d%87%e8%bf%911-%e9%a6%96%e7%88%be%e7%b6%9c%e5%90%88%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e5%a0%b14751%e9%bb%9e%e5%8d%8739%e9%bb%9e",
